{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1585,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "55de4ce263af14817647562a7fd0854a4cb17a23",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fc0cafe100d7ae9bf2c125b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "每位马娘我都见过所以有些犹豫呢\n但非要选一个出来那就是这位了",
      "source_fingerprint": "f592393a04e755534a2d166765268c81ae3a7ff6b7faca5eede8e47e370db861",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d94a451568bbc51cc17247",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "虽然人气不高，但感觉她很有潜力呢\n是我最推荐的赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e924b35474c847ab82deecce8fd0b72de0c51e07bf8ba53d1912d5a9585585",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8b61e21c0b80bbc13fef9c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "能如同流星一般划过跑道\n希望她能证明自己那种一流的速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d26683c00cd463c11f3d6e0dbef376b668721acd505b2a62397a7b31bb9c57c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32a343c0767cf7dc3c83837f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "兼具优秀的速度与力量\n英里路线的最强者肯定就是这位赛马娘了",
      "source_fingerprint": "2931420b7c4abae60cb23fef426ab89a9d3c05f005f118618924de4c4e54ecd7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28227d570e28db510b551a0a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能制霸这强者云集的王道路线\n成为在跑道上绽放光辉的一等星",
      "source_fingerprint": "22d26b98a93152b7eb20f515694234803acbfd1b38eb5ee39ce962fab235e923",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4010e929e225f6439b9d19c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能发挥天生的强大耐力\n展现出永恒闪耀着的明星一样的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c8315c086749511167300906ad28061271358ff5f3a56a016f1286c6ae84fe2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc2a92d21f4af0548c2cb831",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能像沙漠夜空中闪耀的明星一般\n展现出能够给粉丝们带来勇气的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a3ac969c041b11830e3e846b6c7b893ccb82070aa21b66f1c3b79b5a2525b6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51805208a42322c5b26f3ada",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大家的表情都很不错呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "613074b3e993239802d67dadb27d566ae2f22b010e3b23bc8d71027c29a47bf2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25790b8167de6a2b72eda83e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "进入闸门\n每位马娘身上都展现出了很棒的气质",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8f3d597400890de5c8201c43962ec76c512ad56747f2358971bda2212f62e3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:507a60bad816d1cd4999891e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "氛围很棒，有望看到一场精彩比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b074803cb8f7f682bf4486aef4f2d9f44085305a159099b1ab1923a9f8d268c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cab788d75c28af5bca6a67",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在闸门也很冷静，状态不错呢\n期待她能带来一场精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92ec60c639926066e051fbb3f3938934489e66e5a77257dce1968043763e476",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86988bf1d9c8b9f88436a9bb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "这位赛马娘进入闸门后很有气势呢\n值得关注！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f678d6f8f929b437e0d03b4b4f48bf4eb432dddd812189b79632e53bad0b2453",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1896313b277d42dc7230baf2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "能在优骏的顶点大放异彩的会是哪位赛马娘呢\n闪耀明星巅峰赛，现在开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "72ab83c1cc405cd48d8ce736d47386cf8d1af02e9d5a83f08e50ae54cff7cca4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a2f33575c0706ea96c56a1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "群雄逐鹿的精彩比赛\n完全不想把视线移开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3029e7c0afa085691c54d95dd907a9000778cd23ebc2b1e40d9736f9fb259dc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a94d3242c6b53f2129f918f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "能够领先冲线的究竟会是哪位赛马娘呢\n终于到了起跑时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b7b70ed2ff38c9f90f855342bcc994c0f609272111db144f057435b5841d20",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b674cfe2c3fc7e6cb579277",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "向着充满荣誉的终点线\n各赛马娘一同开始冲刺！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2463f9c2c90411b1b8c97af7bfdcff7f7edc5d40480c4510498cdc7cdaad6f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cdba9424562e59be4d4120f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "如同繁星般的赛马娘们\n一口气冲过最终弯道！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aea4a843b440799853842874d91a8344468d13a1431f2812615ade0186a299b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:104840e31ddcc4e04f528038",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "会是前方领跑者顽强取胜，还是后方待机者扭转局面呢\n比赛终于进入巅峰局面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b0642b86bc88bd1f02e4ccc9b5e56b3cb6eda17e7e5c91ac4dd84265f2c54c8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec35cf3aca555f14ad235d75",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在这最重要的比赛上，她为我们展现了一场\n不辱夜空第一星之名的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81bad8223cd386478379cb2da8d020638e44d0b4237e21e07d5e4ae196bbb37b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06b14d1e0130158ba83ff6ea",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "特别周！\n她正是日本总大将\n相当精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a25ff7e5bf4c61c4b1b04fb1a8d40ab3326fac3ffc477f09098b7d1769c4eaa3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dc0dc6f7dd6abc2e5c9cbd2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿！\n这种跑法简直就是异次元的逃亡者\n精彩地一放到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c94007ba035a756a350585ccad1ae0611c2916d3665b2a489ee3fd407f44f38",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cdff64363920f183327a62a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东海帝王！\n为我们创造了超越皇帝的奇迹奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bce8c30c75ebf3e5b82f13d21c99e685f8c3ac2678051ede10f4954c86746f8b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296ca159b43046de720468f9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基！\n她那令人无法匹敌的速度\n正可谓超级跑车！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eaded756025858dac863d5744b8beb12312e2780affbc819a2942dbdd12de80",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e62d2ec8b311767b179b481",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "富士奇石！\n她那宝石般闪耀的奔跑\n牢牢吸引住了全场的目光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ff3be78e634b06504e5baa8a576df72f0f467e744710b90a0cfb7a6bd0153bd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55e8a9bccf3c0c62998065f9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "小栗帽！\n她是被众人所爱的偶像赛马娘\n也是最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e99dd610bd7850e68d8b7e9ca80d8a46efc5dbec524a91b90486d531dd78910",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf8b80edc018d6b8b1c659a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金船！\n不愧为黄金的不沉舰\n为我们展现了豪迈的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0544f10c994e676b8d4e6b53f54aa12c5724d8af0aee6e96308532e46c64774",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b15f276d50e5520ec7235d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "伏特加！\n她那孤高前行的身姿\n正可谓打破常识的女杰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2f4309d348cd6ba7f5f0ee5f6af6047c27d8c4a0341b5425f303d4b787aebbe",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddee98d193248a121500dc3c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥！\n在这大舞台也绝不让出第1名\n为我们展现了完美的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb61a9139728d3e8f36f5eee3d56f5da98622bd1c313fffdbc55fa8a3154a981",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:809dc2da15e945e988e8167d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大树快车！\n她那与生俱来的速度与力量\n为我们展现了一场豪迈的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52631083bf35d7571b998aab34b39c2e7718d692c3e705cf52f235e06c605de0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee54bb680f3437248149f50c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "草上飞！\n朝着顶点勇往直前的大和抚子\n如今成为了当之无愧的俊杰",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd466618874baf5c50315e752fc692f4592971b2c0b983e8382a7814db614002",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b45a185a5d223383ed962a8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊！\n在所有比赛中所表现出的强大而凛然的姿态\n正可谓女杰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7713ffa583df587d3d566cff636d0958e3a3d96a0769a860c3a716e4aeec34d8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0552e5161cc6ecd67c55807",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆！\n胸怀着背负豪门之名的觉悟\n为我们展现了坚强而美丽的名伶的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "715eb90ae25db7a52510cb00002cac50e8b8468fbb3a6643392c7145540baac1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4ee5ef302b0a7b82b36306a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "神鹰！\n在最前方飞驰的怪鸟\n为我们展现了能在世界展翅翱翔的最强奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ec643f0e5cddd3520f594a1b8eea83f645cdb94f27502828f067f67c367c9a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aef9d932aa6b08fb5a2fc5e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "好歌剧！\n她那征服所有赛马娘不断取胜的身姿\n正可谓世纪末霸王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb09efebad466578fa253825141d0ebdc5b9d271017b5ba136855bc1c098fef6",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccedaef7fe25f8dd65d4ab23",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田白仁！\n她的奔跑只能称之为最强\n简直如同怪物一般！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25ac2ed236b0daa0f399e95d3895a9e7dc1ebb49a33d4918aea08deb438973ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54528d3ffca8cbbcb5bb722a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征！\n用完美的奔跑向我们\n展现了她那皇帝君临的自豪感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86158c1174449811613f23b80c1534a33a0890ee00f243ae4e1cbd317f76ffa",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a61cda1bed358b54103711d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "气槽！\n以出色的奔跑为我们\n展示了女帝所追求的理想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05d1a727097716d213e8562135f53183c0fa5bd912cf751f5bf987e168d7775",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f639d1082c9841782f0d7872",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱丽数码！\n跨越无数战场的身影\n正是勇者的姿态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b3ac4bcbed6bb123f968287c74c372ca68487335aff19e6075c91710141c754",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f56528861dfc3f7307cbec4",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "青云天空！\n如晴空漂浮的云朵一般无法触及的身影\n不愧为诡术师！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bb8eedd4d0421dd5f2e43ccbfed30dc4f00ea39000b78e701b2aa2296b10257",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f33ed7b8fe406f77349cb40d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "玉藻十字！\n如闪电一般划过赛场\n为我们展现了她惊人的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5977ad38aa4f36cb602763aad5198a44800121e3aeb4b448dbae7b84c3c167fc",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5316250a9f2303bdf9829b5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美妙姿势！\n胜利是无可替代的荣光\n她在名为比赛的世界中将其纳入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5f26d5e64101f37238bef2faa02c71919689fde56759d26d0865b17f7276279",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88271f14ba1cf71126f0477",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光！\n将「胜利的方程式」构筑完毕\n于此证明了她世代最强的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e62b4d877afb2c1c01767d14e81cf3049324ae059057a47c4c6ead92aca3db2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
