      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0431bdc22a24515e9c8c0935",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮！\n发挥她那罕有的才能\n为我们展现了一场天衣无缝的最强奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58bb1aa3c5188ac87ac997ac85b05cb85cea143abd662b1af09bce49c13366b8",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83717c3cdeac0f0e8be4ce61",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "曼城茶座！\n以划破漆黑般的奔跑\n证明了她立于摩天大楼顶点的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba140b94391f4ea7531784b24c5dae2d3f21167f0f614839033c50fc9938dbf",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00ece0898bc51085bb5b58e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁！\n如赛博格般精确无比的奔跑\n为我们展现了她极致的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f745b8e3ec1a8a616e27f1efdbd4f31e0f1b14bc5acabeed4c929c61c67c9e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d71fc9480b9c4c5d03687c2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩！\n无愧于豪门之名的决心与磨练的力量\n她以强而有力的奔跑将其证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "61190039df49a9a9d1a1c5b667295260cfc4300a827b46e74680780adef4f730",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d42cae351a036756375c3454",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "菱曙！\n她那庞大身躯的奔跑\n也斩获了巨大的荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e854972810e65bd1dc381acb81c6f317b371dacb302572558cc1aee871ea190",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ce356771a0100eab6c4b7c6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "雪之美人！\\n在这场令她接近自己梦想的精彩比赛之中，\\n展现了独她一份的不屈精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8a70f5399240c7a268d86c1448a42192190f5a355037547a21521e6f78bab8e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27e2377285d731af61b78474",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "米浴！\n在怎样的大舞台中都贯彻自我的奔跑\n她正是最强的英雄！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004370100f757784c498b8d4fc53c1ebedd1c33bee86e187e35d229194e8e21f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62d64de27d501ab0a79d516",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "艾尼斯风神！\\n她以狂风般的奔跑\\n成功摘下桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "972724b1d2abe58df223b1e2f305b3010917c3af5633575e2f475dc0faccd1d3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0eb6a5ccb28b23bcb56d751",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱丽速子！\n她那如梦幻般的超光速奔跑\n将我们的梦想变为了现实！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e66874254ce5bd36feb512e8dbe7632ee26664844d9c42ab135343e037a9349",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b44ab543fcdcda05e4a44798",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬！\n怀着比所有人都强烈的觉悟\n为我们展现了与一等星之名相符的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96794faef8b88e27653d92dbe66cd3141fa199db53375eae8a0775dad9357d0a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e376aa66d091d2d1bd4a9455",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "稻荷一！\\n用她那潇洒的奔跑\\n让我们见识到了什么才叫天下无双的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6d0a03b2fb421290c53e4971998d98ff2167a0f2affc547d2ea5b8b39a8e30c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a923bde4ef822b913a27b76",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券！\n在大舞台中以强烈的信念\n展现出了她那作为世代旗手的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d5fb3e9cb7689ee52e590fc8bf27b1ee3e8f8e462431c944b98a3daad5825",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7ef7d4a5ccac1126f9fd85",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "空中神宫！\\n以自己推导出的逻辑\\n证明了其最强的奔跑之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0a28989e918e56d98e073f82f86c9cac88e2e7f4de844e82379e5c97d6944f7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bdd47f57a69be0ba157d798",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "荣进闪耀！\n胸怀自豪与意志\n呈现了一场以自我为宗旨的完美比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d39b4cd5c698e43c02b9079921975660211eb8e8b8cae71bc10c68066f1d7e1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:827a4f2e25c626690e7fe6e0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "真机伶！\n以闪光般的速度\n呈现了一场令所有人都为之心动的精彩比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32f1aa6979cc3f4fd1cc4387e112fc2b5a2a6dc28416882987e6bda4503ef268",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e276051a34b9dd7832d0609",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "川上公主！\n成功打败劲敌\n斩获了公主之证的精彩胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b27c6e376dcf01291e99bc422f18ace7bb475cbc36de07fa80992132cc1fa03",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e0e909ee65a3ca02a35d2dc",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金城市！\n以绝不动摇的意志和自己双腿\n证明了她为比赛赌上一切的强烈意志！",
      "source_fingerprint": "870b9363282b4df9792c64626461077ba80089cb75eb091da9e9f8c8ef8fc299",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddde242c45fcad7f86e73fcb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "樱花进王！\n她那突飞猛进般的奔跑\n爆进王之称果然名不虚传！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f64521f4e9984cdbde1380ea992863ac1faa20d1835245fcbf976b36c438fb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee0015f90e1885620505a9d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "采珠！\\n她展现出了世界级水平的奔跑\\n证明了自己的自信与可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa80e7c62c0db22a26c87cf5242c0f6ec4b19eb6f046c5da77f4731dd007a3a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:452a1f956f2ed7f459ed97aa",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "新光风！！\\n她的斗争心熊熊燃烧，\\n在我们的心中留下鲜明的咬痕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ae4800fe3fe3dcda8fa858d1d4d140b07c566581b812cd436718871e73dd618",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180b7de69007983bdcf7dae0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东商变革！\\n一瞬之间爆发出锋芒\\n为我们展现了魔法般的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a532848cfddb51e3903f6c51ffc74f45ba2f3ebda21aa167a5823160c832ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1d2106e730ad76e07ce9a00",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "超级溪流！\n她用与生俱来的才能与敏锐\n证明了自己领先一切对手的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81371bf152853994e5c12428bf7784d2ffd95c402d7bedb1c3e437226fd030c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:664124132e3770c4d8345f70",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰！\n将观者视线集于一身\n成功登上了顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa0b270d6c968f74918ae077f94243fdeb5b8129534f1127c367f0829716bc29",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36289b55da2d71117e9e171f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "荒漠英雄！\\n如英雄一般勇敢奔跑取得了胜利\\n如同扮演了精彩故事的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af47ff18555c135c7b7a03f28888b98ab62a6136b1fd00d3c84f261019e57085",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca2472109d65f19ae184524",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦！\n以绝不动摇的好胜之心\n为我们展现了无可撼动的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e98649425a168a8046c3abfeede3655e84b4dad92ae1d50419d88516d8458b20",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ca2cdb4fcb8d863907291d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "中山庆典！\\n展现出将一切赌在那一瞬机遇之中的灵魂奔跑\\n精彩地赢下了对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae113addcbd5844e1c765653650545e3952994fef93678ee55cac98e3d04323d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4177d45f2f15f538776ed3cf",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "成田大进！\n充分展示了她那世代第一的速度\n在这大舞台上正面了自己的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac35c0c96c23444014b0638ce942d44338b4e57f22faaafc7372823fb217589a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea864829f95906a9dc7f33",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "西野花！\\n她以可爱且给人以勇气的奔跑\\n令巨大的花朵绽放了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6f24a89f25ac1e01fc3e07132ff71a40f95b8479c6d48aae43aa44de9821567",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb54f2667df3ae7fdba6ed",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "春丽！\n她以永不言弃的不屈精神斩获冠军的身影\n真可谓春光烂漫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc5b8c6b65fc245a6fdf6e361432cc9d50c30fb7339e399aa6bd0ce8c4ee17b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac726379f1ac75f5ca08e05",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "青竹回忆！\\n她着凭自己勇往直前向梦想全力冲刺的精神，\n在这场强敌云集的比赛中胜出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba885a49f500e810091251e14cb29181bbb7c614bdd7af66eb050f94a409966",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e369578b20778eea1c33ae9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "美丽周日！\\n她为我们带来了惊喜与感动\\n那出色的跑法正可谓是Marvelous！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7445401c3d1e8d55b533997e839d8ed8146f87fe5511916d4fa2d343cba37fce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1b8424bd563e90e2ddb446",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼福来！\n她用坚信自己实力的奔跑\n成功将“福”招“来”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb94ca93730bd52edb9cfd60f962983655e53e90ddd3ccf8c40b81ced712709",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c5c1aef52f2ca759d8f94e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "千明代表！\\n她凭借着无拘无束的天真烂漫的跑法\\n展现出了压倒性的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "343103ec28a5e6b5d537f61e8fb79bf68fbae8f5e63ea777093ff0f6e3a59c62",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:005fc524241dc5f8c1a7556a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛！\n胸怀萌生的自信\n斩获了超越霸王的最佳成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "123a1477585dc4757dc3430ae2d4fd11060edf251e76b2a20bb0c84d53b25340",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:411a7679668154b405161fe8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白多伯！\n怀着名门马娘的坚强意志\n为我们展现了精彩的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "62b14281cc43d0b33dd3ef8e417cf8c930701d53b1ee2f5164e0d2e8313bc2ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:041c7af6c1789a878f79c734",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "优秀素质！\n她那优秀的素质成功绽放\n斩获冠军，堂堂正正地回应了大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad4c6abd9b9f97d0b7d64a1953e9a604dabccc05f6ae34ce309e8b8fe3ce51d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6645030f185d3680f169b0ee",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "圣王光环！\n战胜众多强敌\n取得了不负圣王之名的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccd40c00d5864d75130b19a5ddcc7d1359e7970719790ae467b626ce665423d7",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb900c0d7447986a4f9aa1c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧！\n发挥出她那与生俱来的专注力\n展现了足以回应粉丝呼声的出色奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4470dee10be333f91b804b8840547f2ae6b48ea4c19421600a5eb4c1021d0e",
